questions.solution_text:
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);
\coordinate (B) at (2.7,0);
\coordinate (C) at (2.7,1.8);
\coordinate (D) at (0,1.8);
\draw (A)--(B) node[midway,below] {$9\text{ m}$};
\draw (B)--(C) node[midway,right] {$w$};
\draw (C)--(D);
\draw (D)--(A);
\node at (1.35,-1.05) {$P = 30\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
$P = 9 + 9 + w + w$
$30 = 18 + 2w$
$2w = 30 - 18$
$= 12$
$w = \frac{12}{2}$
$= 6 \text{ m}$

